@page "/"

<PageTitle>Smart Parking Navigator</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Workshop starter</p>
    <h1>Find a suitable HDB car park near your destination.</h1>
    <p>
        The Aspire application is running. Use the workshop guides to design and
        implement destination search, live availability, filters, and map-based
        results.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="starter-grid" aria-label="Starter application status">
    <article>
        <h2>Frontend</h2>
        <p>The Blazor Web App is ready for implementation.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
        <h2>Backend</h2>
        <p>ASP.NET Core, health endpoints, and the HDB dataset are wired.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
        <h2>Orchestration</h2>
        <p>.NET Aspire runs both projects and supplies API credentials.</p>
    </article>
</section>
